{"id":"n16611-1-7","stage":2,"title":"서양인 · 西方人","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16611-1-7-1","ko":"나는 미국에 있는 동안 많은 서양인 친구들을 사귀었어.","zh":"我在美国的时候交了很多西方朋友。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"미국에","meaning":"美国","explanation":"미국：美国；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"미국에","audio":"/audio/985bce1e4d8dcb822374.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미국에","audio":"/audio/985bce1e4d8dcb822374.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"동안","meaning":"期间","explanation":"동안：期间","readings":[{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70749","senseId":"1","lemma":"동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많은","audio":"/audio/dac1aa733d550e544bce.mp3"}},{"text":"서양인","meaning":"西方人","explanation":"서양인：西方人","readings":[{"term":"서양인","audio":"/audio/777eadb06d2c51ed9123.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16611","senseId":"1","lemma":"서양인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서양인","audio":"/audio/777eadb06d2c51ed9123.mp3"}},{"text":"친구들을","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구들을","audio":"/audio/c6e57580704d18a02a8d.mp3"}},{"text":"사귀었어.","meaning":"交，结交，交往","explanation":"사귀다：交，结交，交往；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사귀다","audio":"/audio/cdf64a5f4a89467851be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15656","senseId":"1","lemma":"사귀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사귀었어","audio":"/audio/9fd8c3e441a80dc6a67a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"2aa02e1d6b86b37d","term":"동안","zh":"期间","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3","entryId":"70749","definition":"从某一时期另一时期之间的时间长度。","pronunciation":["동안"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"777eadb06d2c51ed","term":"서양인","zh":"西方人","audio":"/audio/777eadb06d2c51ed9123.mp3","entryId":"16611","definition":"西方的人。","pronunciation":["서양인"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"cdf64a5f4a894678","term":"사귀다","zh":"交，结交，交往","audio":"/audio/cdf64a5f4a89467851be.mp3","entryId":"15656","definition":"相互了解并亲近地相处。","pronunciation":["사귀다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4bba8158bca34cd30f08.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16611-1-7-2","ko":"정말 좋은 경험이었구나.","z